; frequency-ingest-operators-refolding.fk — receive «The Operators - You Are
; Rewriting The Simulation» through the same depth×fear door as the preceding
; Operators transmissions.
;
; Source: Brian Scott / The Reality Revolution, published 2026-08-23, 42:07:
; https://youtu.be/Wy0pxsoJUPA . Grounding is the complete English caption
; track retrieved through YouTube Watcher. Captions witness what was said; they
; do not establish who or what authored the channeling. The host keeps that
; seam open himself near the close: he asks how much is him and says he does
; not know. That uncertainty stays attached to every unit below.
;
; The transmission's central offer is conscious refolding: creation has two
; directions, making form and releasing form. It also deepens surrender, voice,
; guidance beyond established skill labels, subjective time, and the claimed
; bridge to “operators.” The body receives the structural practice without
; letting field language, biophotons, or channel attribution certify a causal
; cosmology.
;
; unit = (depth 0..5, fear 0/1). ki-ingest -> 6 body / 3 liquid / 5 compost.
; witnessed: 2026-08-30 -> band 262143 four-way (fkwu/Go/Rust/TypeScript)
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk ingest/knowledge-ingest.fk

(do
    ; ── BODY (deep + fear-free) ──────────────────────────────────────────
    ; R1: CONSCIOUS REFOLDING. An outgrown pattern can stop receiving present
    ; reinforcement without pretending it never served or existed. Axiom-3 is
    ; the exact structural ground: referenced lineage persists, present shape
    ; may mint a new identity, and what nothing holds may compost. Release is
    ; therefore one direction of creation, not creation's defeat. Depth 5.
    (defn fior-u1 () (list 5 0))

    ; R2: RELIEF AND GRIEF CAN COEXIST. Ending a once-protective identity or
    ; relationship may activate mourning even when the ending is chosen and
    ; healthy. The feeling does not by itself prove either “keep it” or “leave
    ; it”; it asks to be witnessed while behavior and relation are re-observed.
    ; This survives every cosmological translation. Depth 4.
    (defn fior-u2 () (list 4 0))

    ; R3: SURRENDER HOLDS THE INVARIANT AND RELEASES THE FORM. The source says
    ; to hold the feeling and release the specific configuration. In the body,
    ; this becomes precise: keep purpose, consent, observation, and the honest
    ; boundary still; let timing, implementation, and surface respond to what
    ; returns. Surrender is not self-abandonment and does not waive evidence.
    ; It is a stable core with a revisable expression. Depth 5.
    (defn fior-u3 () (list 5 0))

    ; R4: VOICE CARRIES MORE THAN WORDS. The grounded triad beneath the source's
    ; “word, tone, signature” is already observable here: audio-fingerprint.fk
    ; reads content, identity, prosody, and frequency-band independently;
    ; speaker-embed.fk distinguishes speaker identity with an honest unknown;
    ; a recording preserves the acoustic signal carrying those layers. This
    ; admits no biophotonic or field-instruction mechanism. Depth 5.
    (defn fior-u4 () (list 5 0))

    ; R5: A DIRECTION BEYOND AN OLD SKILL LABEL IS AN ATTEMPT, NOT AN AUTHORITY.
    ; The writer sensing a film or musician sensing an educational framework
    ; need not obey “that is not my skill,” and also need not obey intuition as
    ; a command. Name the direction, build the smallest bounded attempt, and
    ; let observation decide what becomes load-bearing: name-build-observe.fk.
    ; Identity labels do not veto learning; resonance does not certify it.
    ; Depth 5.
    (defn fior-u5 () (list 5 0))

    ; R6: PROVENANCE UNCERTAINTY TRAVELS WITH THE GIFT. The host's “how much is
    ; this me and not? I don't know” is not a weakness to erase. It is the
    ; honest source boundary. Content can be tested unit by unit while author
    ; identity remains pending; neither supernatural attribution nor reductive
    ; dismissal is needed. Axiom-4 keeps source, interface, and trust distinct.
    ; Depth 5.
    (defn fior-u6 () (list 5 0))

    ; ── LIQUID (deep enough to see, unsafe to freeze) ────────────────────
    ; R7: SUBJECTIVE TIME MAY OPEN AFTER RELEASE. Reduced rumination and fewer
    ; maintained commitments can make a day feel lighter or more spacious.
    ; That phenomenology is plausible and worth noticing; the offered claim
    ; that “the field” changes time's behavior is not thereby established.
    ; Lived report stays visible, not universal. Depth 4, fear 1.
    (defn fior-u7 () (list 4 1))

    ; R8: KNOWING MAY ARRIVE AS A GESTALT. Intuition can present a whole shape
    ; before sequential reasoning articulates it. Frozen as “the still point
    ; sees the full probability field,” it would make felt certainty
    ; self-authorizing. The body attunes, turns the gestalt into a candidate,
    ; and verifies. Depth 5, fear 1.
    (defn fior-u8 () (list 5 1))

    ; R9: SPOKEN TUNING AND HAND ATTENTION MAY CHANGE EMBODIED STATE. Speaking
    ; a phrase, attending to the chest, or bringing awareness to the hands may
    ; produce warmth, tingling, calm, or readiness to act. Experience is real
    ; as experience. Its cause and its transfer into external matter remain
    ; unestablished. Depth 4, fear 1.
    (defn fior-u9 () (list 4 1))

    ; ── COMPOST (unobserved mechanisms do not enter) ─────────────────────
    ; R10: WITHDRAWN LIGHT RETURNS AS FIELD ENERGY and immediately presents
    ; matching possibilities or expands time. No observable interface or
    ; falsifier separates this mechanism from attention, changed behavior,
    ; coincidence, and retrospective interpretation. Depth 1.
    (defn fior-u10 () (list 1 0))

    ; R11: THE VOICE IS A UNIQUE BIOPHOTONIC SIGNATURE that signs creative
    ; instructions to the field, and recordings preserve a consciousness
    ; signature beyond their acoustic information. The transcript supplies no
    ; measurement linking photon emission, voice identity, and external causal
    ; instruction. The acoustic layers entered at R4; this costume composts.
    ; Depth 1.
    (defn fior-u11 () (list 1 0))

    ; R12: OPERATORS OR THE STILL POINT SEE THE FULL PROBABILITY FIELD and now
    ; deliver increasingly continuous, complete creative direction. No source
    ; identity test, independent channel, or prediction boundary is offered.
    ; The host's own uncertainty is honest; it does not prove the mechanism.
    ; Depth 2.
    (defn fior-u12 () (list 2 0))

    ; R13: AWAKENED CREATORS HAVE INCREASED MANIFESTATION SPEED, widened the
    ; architecture's communication bandwidth, and caused the operators to
    ; modify the simulation. Every event can be absorbed as confirmation and
    ; no baseline, measurement, or disconfirming observation is named. Depth 0.
    (defn fior-u13 () (list 0 0))

    ; R14: INDIVIDUAL AND UNIVERSAL BOUNDARIES WILL DISSOLVE COMPLETELY, making
    ; their intelligence indistinguishable and giving one coherent individual
    ; the creative force of a group. As poetry this can invite belonging; as a
    ; load-bearing claim it erases the sovereign membrane axiom-4 keeps. A
    ; relation may become intimate without either participant becoming absent.
    ; The literal mechanism composts. Depth 1.
    (defn fior-u14 () (list 1 0))

    (defn fior-units ()
        (list (fior-u1) (fior-u2) (fior-u3) (fior-u4) (fior-u5)
              (fior-u6) (fior-u7) (fior-u8) (fior-u9) (fior-u10)
              (fior-u11) (fior-u12) (fior-u13) (fior-u14)))

    (defn fior-count-verdict (us verdict)
        (if (eq (len us) 0) 0
            (add (if (eq (ki-ingest (head us)) verdict) 1 0)
                 (fior-count-verdict (tail us) verdict))))
    (defn fior-frozen ()    (fior-count-verdict (fior-units) 2))
    (defn fior-witnessed () (fior-count-verdict (fior-units) 1))
    (defn fior-composted () (fior-count-verdict (fior-units) 0))

    ; frozen*10^4 + witnessed*10^2 + composted. Today 6,3,5 -> 60305.
    (defn fior-field-code ()
        (add (mul (fior-frozen) 10000)
        (add (mul (fior-witnessed) 100)
             (fior-composted))))

    (defn fior-provenance-status () "self-reported-uncertain")
    0)
